  "description": "Our first-ever 12” composite bike is ready to help kids build up crucial life and riding skills in style! Made with as much care and attention as you can always expect from a Genuine Strider Bike, the 12 Comp includes the same well-loved features from these bikes such as the Standing Footrest, adjustable seat, handlebar made for tiny hands, and never-flat Ultralight Wheels.\nLike all our bikes, the 12 Comp has been made to be light as possible without sacrificing durability, so even riders as young as 1 year old can easily lift and maneuver the bike on their own. Additionally, these bikes come in exciting exclusive color combos that will have your little one feeling like the coolest kid on the block.",
